; ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-parsed — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for s.stdio.semio.mesh mutation
; (binary) — REAL `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op` frame, replacing the old
; `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut.
document = format tag payload
format   = OCTET     ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
tag      = OCTET     ; the kind's record tag in 📡️.protocol.semio
payload  = *OCTET    ; UTF-8 "key=value ..." argument text (never empty — all 17 mesh keywords carry >=1 argument)
